+//
+// The caps above are a throughput heuristic for the generic MUL_MAT_ID mmvq-vs-MMQ choice, but
+// they subdivide the decode/verify band (ncols_dst <= MMVQ_MAX_BATCH_SIZE).  Greedy MTP requires a
